  "description": "Noble Blush is a soft and elegant gourmand fragrance that blends creamy sweetness with delicate florals and a warm musky base. The scent feels feminine, smooth, and comforting, offering a lighter and more playful take on the Bade’e Al Oud line. The opening introduces a creamy milk accord with subtle sweetness, creating a soft and inviting first impression that feels smooth and comforting. The heart develops into rose and sugar, adding a delicate floral touch wrapped in a sweet, airy gourmand layer. The base settles into vanilla, musk, and sandalwood, leaving a warm, creamy, and long-lasting trail that feels soft, cozy, and slightly powdery. Noble Blush is perfect for women who enjoy gentle sweet fragrances with a floral gourmand character and a clean musky finish.",
